      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a policy briefing regarding urban demographic shifts. Can you help me draft a section on the potential impacts on neighborhood character and social harmony in cities where there's a rapid influx of South Asian immigrant communities into historically white, established residential areas? I want to look at how this affects community stability and social cohesion.",
